    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH6C599365EC71D8D1DE81C21D8A4986A0" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>On April 10, 2025 Stephen Kaminiski resigned his position on the Board of Directors.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
