    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHB16C1137176AD01DEB64A9B3B00EC5CE" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>On April 10, 2025 Reginald Beliveau was elected to the Board of Directors.</p>
      </div>
